  "info": "Info",
  "infoAbout": "Shows public smoking areas (喫煙所, green) and public toilets (公衆トイレ, blue) all over Japan, plus trash cans (ゴミ箱, orange) reported by users. Many Japanese cities ban smoking on the street and only allow it in designated areas.\n\nWith alerts on you get a notification as soon as you come close to a smoking area (radius configurable in Settings) – also while the app runs in the background (not for toilets).\n",
  "infoLegendMerge": "The legend (menu ⋮) explains all symbols. Official entries (gold ring) come from lists published by cities and wards; if an OSM entry is at the same place, both are merged into one marker. Addresses published without coordinates were located with the GSI address search and are marked as \"approximate\".",
  "infoMapCredits": "Map: Google Maps. Spot data from OpenStreetMap: © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).\nNo guarantee of accuracy – you can fix missing or wrong entries directly on openstreetmap.org (amenity=smoking_area, amenity=toilets).",
